    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search on answer</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/koko-eating-bananas/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 875</a></div>\n  <h1>Koko Eating Bananas</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: \"can I finish at speed k?\" is false, false, ..., true, true as k grows, so binary search the smallest k that says yes, checking each guess with a sum of ceilings. O(n log max) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
